        AddCommGrpCat.{u+1}).obj (AddCommGrpCat.of (ULift.{u+1} ℤ))) B n ≃
      Abelian.Ext ((constantSheaf (Scheme.smallEtaleTopology X) AddCommGrpCat.{u+1}).obj
